"notes":{
"t1":{"x":0,"y":-300,"text":"1 · Today: weights on weighted exercises","kind":"title1","maxW":3580},
"s1":{"x":3660,"y":0,"w":380,"text":"Each weighted row reads sets × reps · weight · gear. The weight is one you own, in its own unit, so one workout can mix kg and lb. Push-up, TRX and Plank show no weight. The weight is bold so it reads at a glance.","fill":"green"},
"t2":{"x":0,"y":1360,"text":"2 · Logging: owned weights only","kind":"title1","maxW":2270},
"s2":{"x":2350,"y":1660,"w":380,"text":"The box starts at the suggested weight; − and + step through owned weights only. Typing a weight you don't own opens the prompt under the box when you leave it (Done or tap away). Add saves it to Dumbbells and keeps it; Cancel puts the box back to 20 kg. Complete set waits until you answer.","fill":"green"},
"s2b":{"x":2350,"y":2280,"w":380,"text":"Adjustable gear (range 5–50 lb every 2.5): typing 55 snaps to 50 lb on leaving the box, with one quiet line saying why. No prompt. An in-range value off the step (say 46) snaps to the nearest step the same way.","fill":"blue"},
"t3":{"x":0,"y":4540,"text":"3 · Bowflex weights and the equipment list","kind":"title1","maxW":4520},
"s3":{"x":4600,"y":4840,"w":380,"text":"Bowflex row loses its kg | lb control and gets the usual summary link. 21 weights is too long to list, so the summary shortens an even run to \"5–105 lb every 5\". Agreed. The Selected strip uses the same form.","fill":"green"},
"t4":{"x":0,"y":6500,"text":"4 · Fixed gear on, no weights yet","kind":"title1","maxW":860},
"s4":{"x":940,"y":6800,"w":380,"text":"Yes, a hint is worth it: switching gear on and then seeing none of it in workouts would look like a bug. One muted line under \"Add weights\". It goes away once a weight is added.","fill":"green"}
},
